MobileNav.jsx:62
Those classes come from the tailwindcss-animate plugin, which isn't installed. I grepped the built stylesheet: the only @keyframes present is Tailwind's own pulse. So the mobile drawer opens instantly with no transition — the class is documenting an animation that doesn't exist. Either delete it (honest) or add the plugin (nice).

