Low
No structured data, robots.txt or sitemap.xml
index.html · public/
A one-page site doesn't need much, but JSON-LD Person markup is what lets Google associate your name with your skills and links — valuable for a name-based search, which is exactly how a recruiter looks you up.

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "name": "Shreejal Pradhan",
  "jobTitle": "MERN-Stack Developer",
  "url": "https://your-domain.com/",
  "sameAs": ["https://github.com/pradhanshreejal0"]
